Package: termr
Version: 1.0.1
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: codetools, grDevices, R6, processx, ps, stats, utils
Suggests: DBI, jsonlite, knitr, RSQLite, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
License: MIT + file LICENSE
MD5sum: da1e5a0919eb165e83dd56dd33f1065b
NeedsCompilation: no
Author: Akims Mensikovs [aut, cre, cph]
Authors@R: person("Akims", "Mensikovs", email = "akimm7926@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
BugReports: https://github.com/41929424/termr/issues
Date/Publication: 2026-10-21 10:20:02 UTC
Description: Build modern reactive terminal applications for data
        workflows in R using reusable widgets, layouts, events, focus
        management and themes. A virtual screen buffer and incremental
        rendering update changed cells, while a headless driver
        supports deterministic application tests.  Includes data tables
        that render visible rows on demand, lazy table sources, data
        inspection, SQL editing and background R workers with progress
        and streamed output.  Optional database support and static
        text, Markdown, HTML, SVG and JSON exports support analytical
        tools and reports without requiring an interactive terminal for
        static output.
Encoding: UTF-8
Maintainer: Akims Mensikovs <akimm7926@gmail.com>
